chx:X_ArgsAndKwargs a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:ArgsAndKwargs ; rdfs:label "threading.Thread(target=print, args=['Cats', 'Dogs', 'Frogs'], kwargs={'sep': ' & '})"@en ; skos:definition "The chapter's call with args=['Cats', 'Dogs', 'Frogs'] and kwargs={'sep': ' & '} printed Cats & Dogs & Frogs, so the list becomes the positional arguments and the dictionary the keyword arguments of the target."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch25/research> .
