chx:X_WrongCallRunsNow a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:WrongCallRunsNow ; rdfs:label "threading.Thread(target=print('Cats', 'Dogs', 'Frogs', sep=' & '))"@en ; skos:definition "The incorrect form from the chapter printed Cats & Dogs & Frogs at once in the main thread and handed the thread None as its target, and the thread was alive afterwards: False, since it had nothing to run."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch25/research> .
