chx:X_ThreadNames a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:ThreadNames ; rdfs:label "threading.Thread(target=f).name"@en ; skos:definition "On Python 3.14.6 the first thread created in a process is named Thread-1 (f), the second Thread-2 (f), and a thread given name='copier' keeps it; the number counts every thread made so far and the function name was added to the default name in Python 3.10."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch25/research> .
