chx:X_DaemonDiesWithProgram a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:DaemonDiesWithProgram ; rdfs:label "threading.Thread(daemon=True)"@en ; skos:definition "A daemon thread that would print after 1 s did not print because the program ended first, with output ['end'] and a run of under 0.8 s (True), while the same thread as a non-daemon thread printed ['end', 'late']."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch25/research> .
