chx:X_DaemonInherited a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:DaemonInherited ; rdfs:label "threading.Thread(daemon=None)"@en ; skos:definition "A thread created without the daemon argument inherits it from its creator: a thread made inside a daemon thread had daemon True, one made in the main thread had False."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch25/research> .
