chx:X_ThreadsSpeedUpWaiting a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:ThreadsSpeedUpWaiting ; rdfs:label "14 threads against 1 thread"@en ; skos:definition "Against a stand-in server that waits 0.05 s per request, the 14-thread downloader finished at least 5 times faster than one thread doing the same 250 requests: True; the seconds of this single run, taken after waiting for a quiet machine, are in the timing record."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch25/research> .
