chx:X_IncrementIsSeveralSteps a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:IncrementIsSeveralSteps ; rdfs:label "counter += 1"@en ; skos:definition "The statement counter += 1 in a function compiled to 5 bytecode steps on Python 3.14.6, among them ['LOAD_GLOBAL', 'BINARY_OP', 'STORE_GLOBAL'], so a thread can be stopped between the read and the write of the variable; it is not one indivisible step."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch25/research> .
