chx:X_LockReleasedOnError a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:LockReleasedOnError ; rdfs:label "with lock:  # an exception inside"@en ; skos:definition "After an exception inside a with-lock block the lock was still locked: False (the with statement had released it), whereas acquire() without release() left it locked: True, which is the reason to prefer the with statement."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch25/research> .
