chx:X_LockNotReentrant a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:LockNotReentrant ; rdfs:label "lock.acquire(timeout=0.2)"@en ; skos:definition "A thread that already held a plain Lock and asked for it again with a 0.2 s timeout got False, while the same request on an RLock got True; without a timeout the first would wait forever."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch25/research> .
