chx:X_EventSignals a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:EventSignals ; rdfs:label "threading.Event().wait()"@en ; skos:definition "A thread waiting on an Event stayed blocked for the 0.3 s before set() was called (True) and went on right after it (True); Event is the tool for 'wait until another thread says go'."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch25/research> .
