chx:X_LocalVariablesAreSafe a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:LocalVariablesAreSafe ; rdfs:label "threading.local()"@en ; skos:definition "Four threads that each summed their own list into a local variable returned [0, 45, 190, 435], and a threading.local() value set in one thread was absent in another; the chapter's advice to use only local variables in the target function is what these two results rest on."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch25/research> .
