chx:X_MapKeepsOrder a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:MapKeepsOrder ; rdfs:label "executor.map"@en ; skos:definition "ThreadPoolExecutor.map returned [0, 1, 2] for tasks that finished in the reverse order, because it yields the results in the order of the inputs, while as_completed yielded them as [2, 1, 0]."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch25/research> .
