chx:X_ResultTimeout a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:ResultTimeout ; rdfs:label "future.result(timeout=0.1)"@en ; skos:definition "result(timeout=0.1) on a task that needed 0.5 s raised TimeoutError, which is the built-in TimeoutError itself since Python 3.11 (True), and the task went on running."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch25/research> .
