chx:X_CancelPending a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:CancelPending ; rdfs:label "executor.shutdown(cancel_futures=True)"@en ; skos:definition "With one worker and five queued 0.2 s tasks, shutdown(cancel_futures=True) cancelled 4 of the tasks that had not started and let 1 finish, because a started task cannot be cancelled."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch25/research> .
