chx:X_GilOnInTheStandardBuild a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:GilOnInTheStandardBuild ; rdfs:label "sys._is_gil_enabled()"@en ; skos:definition "On the standard Python 3.14.6 build sys._is_gil_enabled() was True and the build variable Py_GIL_DISABLED was 0, so the global interpreter lock is on by default, as the glossary of the documentation says."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch25/research> .
