chx:X_FreeBuildScalesWithCores a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:FreeBuildScalesWithCores ; rdfs:label "threads on a CPU-bound loop, free-threaded build"@en ; skos:definition "In the recorded run on the free-threaded build, four CPU-bound tasks took 1.292 s serially, 0.553 s on 2 threads and 0.522 s on 4 threads on 2 CPUs; the 2-thread run took under 0.6 of the serial time: True; single run at load 0.04."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch25/research> .
