chx:X_ProcessPoolSpeedsCpuWork a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:ProcessPoolSpeedsCpuWork ; rdfs:label "multiprocessing.Pool(2) on a CPU-bound loop"@en ; skos:definition "In the recorded run, 4 CPU-bound tasks took 0.963 s serially and 0.667 s on a pool of 2 processes, so processes gave a speedup on the GIL build that threads did not: True; single run."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch25/research> .
