chx:X_ThreadLimitOfTheMachine a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:ThreadLimitOfTheMachine ; rdfs:label "starting many threads"@en ; skos:definition "Starting 2,000 threads that each waited on one Event succeeded in this container (True) and all 2,001 thread objects including the main thread were alive at the same time: True, so the practical limit for I/O-bound threads on this machine was far above the 14 threads of the chapter; the limit differs from machine to machine and was not searched for."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch25/research> .
