chx:X_NotExecutedList a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:NotExecutedList ; rdfs:label "NOT EXECUTED"@en ; skos:definition "What this machine cannot or did not run is stated: the free-threaded 3.13 build, a C extension that re-enables the lock, Windows and macOS thread behaviour, more than 2 CPUs, the real xkcd.com site, and runs under load; the machine had 2 CPUs, no GPU is used, and the platform was Linux."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch25/research> .
